From: Maksim Kruzeman <kruzeman@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Input: himax_hx83102e: unregister the power-supply notifier on deinit

himax_chip_common_init() registers a power_supply notifier when
HX_USB_DETECT_GLOBAL is set (it is, see himax_common.h), but
himax_chip_common_deinit() never unregisters it. After the module is
reloaded - which this port does at boot to win the TDDI probe race - the
notifier block stays in the global power_supply chain pointing into the
freed module image. The next power-supply event calls that dangling
pointer, CFI catches the signature mismatch and the kernel dies:

  CFI failure at notifier_call_chain+0x98/0x1d8
    (target: himax_GESTURE_write+0x124/0x1e8 [himax_hx83102e])
  Internal error: Oops - CFI

On the tablet this shows as "the screen stops reacting and the device
hangs until a power cycle", sshd still accepting TCP but never sending a
banner.

Unregister the notifier, destroy its workqueue and free the container in
deinit, mirroring the probe error path. Apply after the input-unregister
patch: the context includes lines it adds.

diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/himax_hx83102e/himax_common.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/himax_hx83102e/himax_common.c
index 6afade7..e9e1dd2 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/himax_hx83102e/himax_common.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/himax_hx83102e/himax_common.c
@@ -3408,6 +3408,24 @@ void himax_chip_common_deinit(void)
 			input_free_device(ts->hx_pen_dev);
 		ts->hx_pen_dev = NULL;
 	}
+#if defined(HX_USB_DETECT_GLOBAL)
+	/*
+	 * Симметрия с probe: без этой отписки power_supply-notifier остаётся
+	 * в глобальной цепочке и указывает в выгруженный модуль. Любое событие
+	 * питания (воткнули/вынули зарядку) зовёт мёртвый указатель, CFI ловит
+	 * несовпадение сигнатуры и ядро падает в Oops — на практике это
+	 * "CFI failure at notifier_call_chain ... target: himax_GESTURE_write"
+	 * и зависание планшета сразу после перезагрузки модуля тачскрина.
+	 */
+	if (ts->charger_detection) {
+		if (ts->charger_detection->charger_notif.notifier_call)
+			power_supply_unreg_notifier(&ts->charger_detection->charger_notif);
+		if (ts->charger_detection->himax_charger_notify_wq)
+			destroy_workqueue(ts->charger_detection->himax_charger_notify_wq);
+		kfree(ts->charger_detection);
+		ts->charger_detection = NULL;
+	}
+#endif
 #if defined(HX_CONTAINER_SPEED_UP)
 	cancel_delayed_work_sync(&ts->ts_int_work);
 	destroy_workqueue(ts->ts_int_workqueue);
